    <briefdescription>
<para>Read-time options for <ref refid="classstar_1_1StarDataset_1a7da82ee4803e6302ad903e12e3c4c0c7" kindref="member">StarDataset::open()</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Distinct from <ref refid="structstar_1_1StarConfig" kindref="compound">StarConfig</ref>, which configures how a NEW dataset is <emphasis>written</emphasis> by create() (compression, block sizes). <ref refid="structstar_1_1OpenOptions" kindref="compound">OpenOptions</ref> only affects how an existing dataset is <emphasis>read</emphasis>; nothing here is persisted to the .stards file, so it is a per-open setting (and can also be changed after open — see StarDataset::set_layer_inheritance / set_open_options). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
